{"task_id": "Mbpp/7", "solution": "def find_char_long(input_string: str) -> list[str]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Filters words from a string that are at least 4 characters long.\n    Preserves original case and treats words as whitespace-separated sequences.\n    \"\"\"\n    words = input_string.split()\n    filtered_words = []\n    for word in words:\n        if len(word) >= 4:\n            filtered_words.append(word)\n    return filtered_words"}
