{"task_id": "Mbpp/61", "solution": "def count_Substrings(s: str) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Count substrings where sum of digits equals substring length.\n    Iterates through all substrings, calculates digit sum, and checks against length.\n    \"\"\"\n    count = 0\n    n = len(s)\n\n    for i in range(n):\n        current_sum = 0\n        for j in range(i, n):\n            # Convert current character to integer and add to sum\n            current_sum += int(s[j])\n            \n            # Calculate the length of the current substring (from i to j)\n            current_length = j - i + 1\n            \n            # Check if sum of digits equals substring length\n            if current_sum == current_length:\n                count += 1\n                \n    return count"}
