{"task_id": "Mbpp/61", "solution": "def generate_substrings(s):\n    \"\"\"Generates all contiguous substrings from the input string.\n    Yields each substring for processing.\"\"\"\n    for i in range(len(s)):\n        for j in range(i + 1, len(s) + 1):\n            yield s[i:j]\n\ndef calculate_digit_sum(substring):\n    \"\"\"Calculates the sum of digit values in a given substring.\n    Each character is converted to an integer and summed.\"\"\"\n    return sum(int(char) for char in substring)\n\ndef is_valid_substring(substring):\n    \"\"\"Checks if the sum of digits in a substring equals its length.\n    Returns True if valid, False otherwise.\"\"\"\n    return calculate_digit_sum(substring) == len(substring)\n\ndef count_Substrings(s):\n    \"\"\"Counts substrings where the sum of digits equals the substring length.\n    Orchestrates helper functions to process all contiguous substrings.\"\"\"\n    count = 0\n    for substring in generate_substrings(s):\n        if is_valid_substring(substring):\n            count += 1\n    return count"}
