{"task_id": "Mbpp/75", "solution": "def find_tuples(tuple_list, k):\n    \"\"\"\n    Filters a list of tuples, returning only those where all elements are evenly divisible by k.\n    This function efficiently processes the input list while preserving order.\n    \"\"\"\n    filtered_tuples = []\n    for current_tuple in tuple_list:\n        all_elements_divisible = True\n        for element in current_tuple:\n            if element % k != 0:\n                all_elements_divisible = False\n                break\n        if all_elements_divisible:\n            filtered_tuples.append(current_tuple)\n            \n    return filtered_tuples"}
