{"task_id": "Mbpp/84", "solution": "```python\ndef sequence(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculate the nth number in the Newman-Conway sequence.\n    This implementation uses memoization for efficient recursive calculation.\n    \"\"\"\n    memo = {}\n\n    def _calculate_newman_conway(k: int) -> int:\n        if k in memo:\n            return memo[k]\n\n        if k == 1 or k == 2:\n            result = 1\n        else:\n            p_n_minus_1 = _calculate_newman_conway(k - 1)\n            result = _calculate_newman_conway(p_n_minus_1) + _calculate_newman_conway(k - p_n_minus_1)\n\n        memo[k] = result\n        return result\n\n    return _calculate_newman_conway(n)\n```"}
