{"task_id": "Mbpp/103", "solution": "```python\ndef _compute_eulerian_recursive(n: int, m: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Compute Eulerian number using recursive definition.\"\"\"\n    if m < 0 or m >= n:\n        return 0\n    \n    if n == 0 and m == 0:\n        return 1\n\n    if m == 0:\n        return 1\n    \n    term1 = (m + 1) * _compute_eulerian_recursive(n - 1, m)\n    term2 = (n - m) * _compute_eulerian_recursive(n - 1, m - 1)\n    return term1 + term2\n\ndef _validate_inputs(n: int, m: int) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"Validate that inputs are non-negative integers.\"\"\"\n    return n >= 0 and m >= 0\n\ndef eulerian_num(n: int, m: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculate Eulerian number A(n, m).\"\"\"\n    _validate_inputs(n, m)\n    return _compute_eulerian_recursive(n, m)\n```"}
