{"task_id": "Mbpp/137", "solution": "```python\ndef count_zeros(array: list[int]) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Counts the number of zero values in an array.\n    Iterates through elements and increments count for each zero.\n    \"\"\"\n    zero_count_val = 0\n    for element in array:\n        if element == 0:\n            zero_count_val += 1\n    return zero_count_val\n\ndef count_non_zeros(array: list[int]) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Counts the number of non-zero values in an array.\n    Iterates through elements and increments count for each non-zero.\n    \"\"\"\n    non_zero_count_val = 0\n    for element in array:\n        if element != 0:\n            non_zero_count_val += 1\n    return non_zero_count_val\n\ndef calculate_ratio(zeros: int, non_zeros: int) -> float:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the ratio of zeros to non-zeros.\n    Performs division of zero count by non-zero count.\n    \"\"\"\n    return float(zeros) / non_zeros\n\ndef zero_count(array: list[int]) -> float:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the ratio of zero values to non-zero values in an array.\n    Orchestrates counting zeros and non-zeros, then calculates their ratio.\n    \"\"\"\n    zeros = count_zeros(array)\n    non_zeros = count_non_zeros(array)\n    return calculate_ratio(zeros, non_zeros)\n```"}
