{"task_id": "Mbpp/172", "solution": "def count_occurance(input_string: str) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Count non-overlapping occurrences of 'std' in the input string.\n    This function efficiently finds all non-overlapping occurrences in O(n) time.\n    \"\"\"\n    count = 0\n    start_index = 0\n    pattern = \"std\"\n    pattern_len = len(pattern)\n\n    while True:\n        index = input_string.find(pattern, start_index)\n        if index != -1:\n            count += 1\n            start_index = index + pattern_len\n        else:\n            break\n    return count"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/172", "solution": "def count_occurance(input_string: str) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Counts non-overlapping occurrences of 'std' in the input string.\n    Achieves O(n) time complexity and O(1) space complexity.\n    \"\"\"\n    count = 0\n    pattern = \"std\"\n    pattern_len = len(pattern)\n    i = 0\n    n = len(input_string)\n\n    while i <= n - pattern_len:\n        if input_string[i:i + pattern_len] == pattern:\n            count += 1\n            i += pattern_len  # Move past the found occurrence\n        else:\n            i += 1  # Move to the next character\n\n    return count"}
