{"task_id": "Mbpp/422", "solution": "def find_Average_Of_Cube(n: int) -> float:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the average of cubes of the first n natural numbers.\n    It utilizes the mathematical formula for the sum of cubes to compute the average efficiently.\n    \"\"\"\n    # Calculate the sum of cubes of the first n natural numbers using the formula: (n * (n + 1) / 2)^2\n    sum_of_cubes = (n * (n + 1) // 2) ** 2\n    \n    # Calculate the average by dividing the sum of cubes by n\n    average = sum_of_cubes / n\n    \n    return average"}
