{"task_id": "Mbpp/451", "solution": "def remove_whitespaces(input_string: str) -> str:\n    \"\"\"Removes all whitespace characters from the input string.\n    Processes the string efficiently to build a new string without whitespaces.\"\"\"\n    return \"\".join(char for char in input_string if not char.isspace())"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/453", "solution": "```python\ndef _find_factors(n: int) -> list[int]:\n    \"\"\"Helper function to find all factors of n.\n    It iterates from 1 to n to identify all divisors.\"\"\"\n    factors = []\n    for i in range(1, n + 1):\n        if n % i == 0:\n            factors.append(i)\n    return factors\n\ndef _filter_even_factors(factors: list[int]) -> list[int]:\n    \"\"\"Helper function to filter even factors.\n    It checks each factor for divisibility by 2.\"\"\"\n    even_factors = []\n    for factor in factors:\n        if factor % 2 == 0:\n            even_factors.append(factor)\n    return even_factors\n\ndef _calculate_sum(even_factors: list[int]) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Helper function to calculate sum of factors.\n    It sums all elements in the provided list.\"\"\"\n    return sum(even_factors)\n\ndef sumofFactors(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Main function to calculate sum of even factors.\n    It orchestrates factor discovery, filtering, and summation.\"\"\"\n    all_factors = _find_factors(n)\n    even_factors = _filter_even_factors(all_factors)\n    return _calculate_sum(even_factors)\n```"}
