{"task_id": "Mbpp/473", "solution": "def normalize_tuple(t: tuple) -> tuple:\n    \"\"\"Normalizes a tuple by sorting its elements, ensuring order-independent comparison.\"\"\"\n    return tuple(sorted(t))\n\ndef tuple_intersection(list1: list, list2: list) -> set:\n    \"\"\"\n    Computes the intersection of tuples from two lists, treating tuples as equivalent regardless of element order.\n    Returns the intersection as a set of normalized tuples.\n    \"\"\"\n    normalized_set1 = {normalize_tuple(t) for t in list1}\n    normalized_set2 = {normalize_tuple(t) for t in list2}\n    return normalized_set1.intersection(normalized_set2)"}
