{"task_id": "Mbpp/473", "solution": "def _normalize_tuple(tup: tuple) -> tuple:\n    \"\"\"\n    Normalize tuple by sorting its elements.\n    It returns a new tuple with elements in sorted order.\n    \"\"\"\n    return tuple(sorted(tup))\n\ndef tuple_intersection(list1: list, list2: list) -> set:\n    \"\"\"\n    Find intersection of tuples between two lists, treating tuples as equivalent\n    regardless of element order.\n    \"\"\"\n    normalized_list2_forms = {_normalize_tuple(tup) for tup in list2}\n    intersection_result = set()\n\n    for original_tup1 in list1:\n        if _normalize_tuple(original_tup1) in normalized_list2_forms:\n            intersection_result.add(original_tup1)\n\n    return intersection_result"}
