{"task_id": "Mbpp/612", "solution": "```python\nfrom typing import List\n\ndef merge(input_list: List[List]) -> List[List]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Transforms a list of two-element sublists into two separate lists grouped by element position.\n    Collects first elements into one list and second elements into another, maintaining order.\n    \"\"\"\n    first_elements = []\n    second_elements = []\n\n    for sublist in input_list:\n        first_elements.append(sublist[0])\n        second_elements.append(sublist[1])\n\n    return [first_elements, second_elements]\n```"}
