{"task_id": "Mbpp/722", "solution": "def _meets_criteria(height: float, weight: float, min_height: float, min_weight: float) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"\n    Check if student meets both height and weight criteria.\n    Returns True if student meets both criteria, False otherwise.\n    \"\"\"\n    return height >= min_height and weight >= min_weight\n\ndef filter_data(student_dict: dict, min_height: float, min_weight: float) -> dict:\n    \"\"\"\n    Filter students based on minimum height and weight criteria.\n    Returns a dictionary containing only students who meet both criteria.\n    \"\"\"\n    filtered_students = {}\n    for name, measurements in student_dict.items():\n        student_height, student_weight = measurements\n        if _meets_criteria(student_height, student_weight, min_height, min_weight):\n            filtered_students[name] = measurements\n    return filtered_students"}
