{"task_id": "Mbpp/731", "solution": "```python\nimport math\n\ndef lateralsurface_cone(radius: float, height: float) -> float:\n    # Calculates the lateral surface area of a cone.\n    # Uses the formula pi * r * sqrt(r^2 + h^2) with floating-point precision.\n    slant_height = math.sqrt(radius**2 + height**2)\n    lateral_area = math.pi * radius * slant_height\n    return lateral_area\n```"}
