{"task_id": "Mbpp/748", "solution": "def capital_words_spaces(input_string: str) -> str:\n    \"\"\"Inserts spaces between words that start with capital letters, preserving original capitalization.\"\"\"\n    result = []\n    for i, char in enumerate(input_string):\n        # Insert a space if it's not the first character, current is uppercase, and previous was lowercase.\n        if i > 0 and char.isupper() and input_string[i-1].islower():\n            result.append(' ')\n        result.append(char)\n    return \"\".join(result)"}
