{"task_id": "Mbpp/786", "solution": "```python\ndef right_insertion(array, target_value):\n    \"\"\"\n    Locates the rightmost insertion point for a target value in a sorted array.\n    This uses a binary search algorithm to achieve O(log n) time complexity.\n    \"\"\"\n    left = 0\n    right = len(array)\n\n    while left < right:\n        mid = left + (right - left) // 2\n        if array[mid] <= target_value:\n            left = mid + 1\n        else:\n            right = mid\n    return left\n```"}
