{"task_id": "Mbpp/806", "solution": "```python\ndef max_run_uppercase(input_string: str) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Finds the maximum run of consecutive ASCII uppercase characters (A-Z).\n    Returns 0 for empty strings or strings without uppercase characters.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not input_string:\n        return 0\n\n    def is_ascii_uppercase(char: str) -> bool:\n        \"\"\"Checks if a character is an ASCII uppercase letter (A-Z).\"\"\"\n        return 'A' <= char <= 'Z'\n\n    max_run = 0\n    current_run = 0\n\n    for char in input_string:\n        if is_ascii_uppercase(char):\n            current_run += 1\n        else:\n            current_run = 0\n        max_run = max(max_run, current_run)\n\n    return max_run\n```"}
